abase course.\n\n5.**All students working in the lab are instructed by professor David.**.\n   - This implies that if a student is working in the lab, they must be instructed by professor David.\n\n6.**James is a student working in the lab.**.\n   - This tells us that James is working in the lab.\n\nJames has a part-time job offered by the university and works in the lab.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
