 all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal, and everyone who lost to Rafael Nadal is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (because Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022), it follows that all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are not ranked highly by the WTA.Coco Gauff has not defeated Rafael Nadal at Roland Garros 2022.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
