rvice, as indicated in point 5. The information does not deny the availability of take-out service at Subway, so we cannot definitively state that it does not provide this option. Therefore, it is uncertain whether Subway offers take-out service based on the provided details.\n\nHence, the correct answer is:.\nB) False.\n</consider>.\n<response>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
