n apartment in a managed building if and only if he is allowed to move in with Fluffy, and the security deposit is no more than $1500**: This condition states that Tom can rent an apartment in a managed building only if he is allowed to move in with Fluffy and the security deposit is no more than $1500.\n\nNow, let\'s evaluate the given information:.\n\n- The Olive Garden is a managed building.\nSince the security deposit can be either $2000 or more than $2000, and Tom wants the security deposit to be no more than $1500, it is certain that the security deposit will be $2000 or more than $2000. Therefore, we can definitively say that Tom is not allowed to move in with Fluffy and the security deposit is more than $1500. Thus, the correct answer is: A) Certain.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
