nformation does not directly pertain to Rock\'s classification as a monkey, focusing instead on its flying or avian characteristics.\n\n- The assertion that "If Rock is not a fly or a bird, then Rock does not fly or breathe" is also made, but this does not directly address Rock\'s classification as a monkey but rather its flying or respiratory abilities.\n\nBased on the information at hand, there is no conclusive evidence to confirm or disprove the statement "Rock is not a monkey." Therefore, the statement remains uncertain given the available information.\n\n</ponder>.\n<conclusion>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
