messages:   66%|######5   | 134/204 [02:30<00:26,  2.67it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIf a player is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association, then they are among the most active players in major tennis. Everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association. All female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek. Either female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 or male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022. All male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal. If Coco Gauff is a player who is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain", '<think>\nTo determine whether the statement "Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis" is true, false, or uncertain, let\'s analyze the given information step by step:\n\n1.**Context Analysis**:\n   - Players ranked highly by the Women\'s Tennis Association (WTA) are among the most active players in major tennis.\n   - Everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - All female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek.\n   - Either female or male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek.\n   - All male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal.\n   - If Coco Gauff is a player who is ranked highly by the WTA or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n\n2.**Question Breakdown**:\n   - We need to determine if Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis.\n\n3.**Reasoning**:\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and Coco Gauff is a female tennis player (as she is mentioned in the context), she must have lost to Iga Świątek.\n   - However, the statement also mentions that Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.This means she cannot be one of the most active players in major tennis because the most active players are typically male players (as mentioned in the context).\nThe statement is not true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
