ry day after noon and spends their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home or does not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon nor spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.\n\n2.**Analyze the implications of Remy\'s behavior:**.\n   - If Remy goes to bed late and wakes up every day after noon, they do not spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.\n   - If Remy does not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon, they spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.\n\n3.**Determine if Remy has a fully stocked and impressive home office:**.\n   - The context states that all people who work regularly and often at home have a large desktop monitor at their home.\n   - Since Remy either spends their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home or does not, and given that Remy works regularly and often at home, it implies that Remy has a large desktop monitor at their home.\n   - Therefore, Remy has a large desktop monitor at their home, which is a requirement for having a fully stocked and impressive home office.\n\n4.**Determine if Remy visits the office supply store regularly:**.Based on the analysis, Remy has a sparsely equipped and unimpressive home office and also never visits the office supply store regularly.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
