 is from Belgium.\n   - Therefore, we cannot definitively conclude that Descampe is in the six-way tie based on the given information.\n\n4.**Conclusion**:.\nThe statement "Descampe is NOT in the six-way tie in the leaderboard of the 1992 du Maurier Classic" is certain because the information provided explicitly confirms this fact.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
